doc:Factsarticle1_43 schema:abstract "The study proposes an integrated approach for incipient bearing fault diagnosis and detection by fusing features from acceleration and acoustic emission sensors. Multidomain features are selected using correlation and standard deviation, weighted with Softmax, and processed by the semisupervised S4VM model for real-time diagnosis."@en .
